Note, Latin vocabulary trainer using lists and dictionaries.

Create a dictionary called vocab.
Set the entry aqua in vocab to water.
Set the entry terra in vocab to earth.
Set the entry ignis in vocab to fire.
Set the entry ventus in vocab to wind.
Set the entry caelum in vocab to sky.

Let correct be 0.
Let total be 0.

Let words be the keys of vocab.

For each word in words,
    Let answer be the entry the value of word in vocab.
    Say the value of word.
    Ask for guess with the message What does it mean.

    If the value of guess is equal to the value of answer,
        Say Correct.
        Add 1 to correct.
    Otherwise,
        Say Wrong.
        Say The correct answer is.
        Say the value of answer.
    End if.

    Add 1 to total.
End for each.

Say You got.
Say the value of correct.
Say out of.
Say the value of total.
